<div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">Submit Data</div>
    <div class="panel-body">

        <p><strong>Have data you want to submit to <% our $T3_INSTANCE_NAME %>?</strong></p>

        <p>Send us your data in <strong><em>any format</em></strong> and we will wrangle it for you.</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
            <img id="data-submission-img"src="/static_content/img/data-submission.png" />
        </div>

        <a href="<% our $T3_PRODUCTION_URL %>/guides/data-submission" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Submit Data</a>

        <br /><hr /><br />

        <p><strong>Want to try uploading data yourself?</strong></p>

        <p>Follow these instructions on how to upload data to the sandbox instance</p>

        <div style="margin: 15px 0" class="btn-group btn-group-vertical btn-block" role="group">
            <a class="btn btn-info" href="/help/phenotype_quick_start">
                <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-tasks"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Guided Workflow
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-info" href="/help/phenotype_upload_workflow">
                <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Detailed Upload Instructions
            </a>
        </div>

% if ( $c->config->{allow_trial_submissions} ) {
            <p>Then submit your data to the production database by either:
                <ul>
                    <li>Clicking the <strong>Submit Trial</strong> button on the trial detail page of each trial you want to submit</li>
                    <span style="margin: 10px 0; display: block;">OR</span>
                    <li>Creating a list of multiple trials to submit and submit them all at once from the <a href="/submit/trials">Submit Multiple Trials</a> page.</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
% } else {
            <p>In order for the data to be included in the primary production database, please submit your data to us using the data submission form above once it is ready.</p>
% }


    </div>
</div>


<style>
    #data-submission-img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 120px;
        height: auto;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
</style>